          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-muted border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") /canvas
        div
          h3(className="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-foreground group-hover:text-foreground transition") 01 — Real-Time Collaborative Canvas
          p(className="text-[13px] text-muted-foreground mt-1 leading-relaxed") Superior reactivity and fine-grained state sync. Only re-renders changed pixels, not entire canvas. WebSocket delta sync, presence cursors, 60fps strokes.
        div.flex.flex-wrap.gap-1.5.mt-1
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") useState + effect
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") delta sync
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") ResizeObserver
        div(className="mt-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-accent-1 flex items-center gap-1") Open demo
      a(className="group bg-background p-6 hover:bg-card transition flex flex-col gap-4" href="/form")
        div.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-4
          div(className="w-8 h-8 rounded-xs bg-accent-2 text-foreground grid place-items-center text-[12px] font-mono border border-accent-2") ✓
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-muted border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") /form
        div
          h3(className="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-foreground group-hover:text-foreground transition") 02 — Adaptive Form with Validation Streams
          p(className="text-[13px] text-muted-foreground mt-1 leading-relaxed") Composable async flows and cancellation. Debounced 300ms, cancelOnUpdate, race handling. No manual subscriptions.
        div.flex.flex-wrap.gap-1.5.mt-1
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") derive + cancel
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") AbortController
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") optimistic UI
        div(className="mt-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-accent-2 flex items-center gap-1") Open demo
      a(className="group bg-background p-6 hover:bg-card transition flex flex-col gap-4" href="/grid")
        div.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-4
          div(className="w-8 h-8 rounded-xs bg-accent-1 text-foreground grid place-items-center text-[12px] font-mono border border-accent-1") ⊞
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-muted border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") /grid
        div
          h3(className="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-foreground group-hover:text-foreground transition") 03 — Virtualized Masonry Grid
          p(className="text-[13px] text-muted-foreground mt-1 leading-relaxed") Zero-config performance. Built-in virtualization + masonry, ResizeObserver remeasure, 10k+ items, overscan, dynamic heights.
        div.flex.flex-wrap.gap-1.5.mt-1
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") virtualize
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") ResizeObserver
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") columns
        div(className="mt-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-accent-1 flex items-center gap-1") Open demo
      a(className="group bg-background p-6 hover:bg-card transition flex flex-col gap-4" href="/shell")
        div.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-4
          div(className="w-8 h-8 rounded-xs bg-accent-2 text-foreground grid place-items-center text-[12px] font-mono border border-accent-2") ◈
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-muted border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") /shell
        div
          h3(className="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-foreground group-hover:text-foreground transition") 04 — Isomorphic Shell with Progressive Hydration
          p(className="text-[13px] text-muted-foreground mt-1 leading-relaxed") Seamless SSR without hydration mismatches. Same component server + client. suspend/resume, hydration when idle/visible/interaction.
        div.flex.flex-wrap.gap-1.5.mt-1
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") Hydrate
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") Suspense
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") lazy
        div(className="mt-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-accent-2 flex items-center gap-1") Open demo
      a(className="group bg-background p-6 hover:bg-card transition flex flex-col gap-4" href="/timeline")
        div.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-4
