          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-muted border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") /timeline
        div
          h3(className="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-foreground group-hover:text-foreground transition") 05 — Timeline — Time as Dimension
          p(className="text-[13px] text-muted-foreground mt-1 leading-relaxed") Every signal gets .timeline(). Scrub, fork, diff. Structural sharing, branch from any point.
        div.flex.flex-wrap.gap-1.5.mt-1
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") timeline
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") fork
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") structural sharing
        div(className="mt-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-accent-1 flex items-center gap-1") Open demo
      a(className="group bg-background p-6 hover:bg-card transition flex flex-col gap-4" href="/worker")
        div.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-4
          div(className="w-8 h-8 rounded-xs bg-accent-2 text-foreground grid place-items-center text-[12px] font-mono border border-accent-2") ⚙
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-muted border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") /worker
        div
          h3(className="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-foreground group-hover:text-foreground transition") 06 — Worker — Zero-Cost Threading
          p(className="text-[13px] text-muted-foreground mt-1 leading-relaxed") SharedArrayBuffer auto-proxy, 120fps physics without blocking. Gravity slider updates worker instantly.
        div.flex.flex-wrap.gap-1.5.mt-1
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") SharedArrayBuffer
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") Atomics
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") ~0ms
        div(className="mt-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-accent-2 flex items-center gap-1") Open demo
      a(className="group bg-background p-6 hover:bg-card transition flex flex-col gap-4" href="/motion")
        div.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-4
          div(className="w-8 h-8 rounded-xs bg-accent-1 text-foreground grid place-items-center text-[12px] font-mono border border-accent-1") ◎
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-muted border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") /motion
        div
          h3(className="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-foreground group-hover:text-foreground transition") 07 — Motion — Animation Orchestrator
          p(className="text-[13px] text-muted-foreground mt-1 leading-relaxed") Interruptible springs, velocity preserved, mode:'interrupt'. No Framer 40kb.
        div.flex.flex-wrap.gap-1.5.mt-1
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") spring
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") interrupt
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") onPan
        div(className="mt-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-accent-1 flex items-center gap-1") Open demo
      a(className="group bg-background p-6 hover:bg-card transition flex flex-col gap-4" href="/streaming")
        div.flex.items-start.justify-between.gap-4
          div(className="w-8 h-8 rounded-xs bg-accent-2 text-foreground grid place-items-center text-[12px] font-mono border border-accent-2") ⇡
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-muted border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") /streaming
        div
          h3(className="text-[15px] font-medium tracking-[-0.01em] text-foreground group-hover:text-foreground transition") 08 — Streaming — Edge at CDN
          p(className="text-[13px] text-muted-foreground mt-1 leading-relaxed") Streams progressively from edge — yield skeleton then each card. Keyed cache at CDN.
        div.flex.flex-wrap.gap-1.5.mt-1
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") streaming
          span(className="px-2 py-1 rounded-xs bg-card border border-border text-[11px] font-mono text-muted-foreground") edge
